{"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Events\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/discoveredevent"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Events","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ConsentCategory","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventSchema\/Enumeration"],"title":"Events"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"An event type found in the running program: one declared with ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Event","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or one of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"library’s own events, with its schema.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DiscoveredEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"DiscoveredEvent","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DiscoveredEvent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent.swift#L41"},"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:6Events15DiscoveredEventV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DiscoveredEvent","kind":"identifier"}]},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/schema","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/type"],"title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all"],"title":"Type Properties"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DiscoveredEvent"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" lists every one the program links, from every module, so a store or a tracking plan","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can be built from it with no list to keep: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SegmentStore()"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DatabaseStore(database:)"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlan()"},{"text":" each use it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","DiscoveredEvent.all.map { $0.type.name }","\/\/ [\"ApplicationBackgrounded\", ..., \"SessionStarted\", \"signed_up\"]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":" struct is discovered, wherever it is declared, unless it is generic or nested in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a generic type, as neither can hold the record ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":" places in the binary; the macro notes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each one where it is declared. One declared in an extension of a generic type doesn’t compile.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The library’s own events are discovered too: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionStarted"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SessionEnded"},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScreenViewed"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ControlActivated"},{"text":" and the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Application"},{"text":" events of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LifecycleTracking"},{"text":", once","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"their modules are linked. An event that conforms to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Event"},{"text":" by hand, without ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"text":", isn’t:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list it beside the discovered ones, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DiscoveredEvent.all.map(\\.type) + [Legacy.self]"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Limits","anchor":"Limits","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"On Linux and the other ELF platforms, only the image that links ","type":"text"},{"code":"Events","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is read, which is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the whole program as SwiftPM and Bazel link Swift there. Events in a library loaded on its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own, a dynamic library or a plugin, aren’t found.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An object file in a static archive that nothing references brings no record into the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"program: the linker leaves it out. That happens with CocoaPods’ static libraries, a static"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"XCFramework, or a Bazel library with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alwayslink = False"},{"type":"text","text":". SwiftPM, and Bazel’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alwayslink = True"},{"type":"text","text":", link every object file."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","type":"reference"},{"text":" holds the events of the images loaded when it is called; a framework loaded later","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"adds its events from then on.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Object formats other than Mach-O and ELF, such as COFF on Windows and WebAssembly’s, have no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"events found: ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/all","isActive":true},{"text":" is empty there.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events/DiscoveredEvent/schema":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DiscoveredEvent\/schema","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"schema","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventSchemaV","text":"EventSchema","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The event’s schema.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/events\/discoveredevent\/schema","title":"schema","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/EventSchema":{"title":"EventSchema","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EventSchema","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventSchema","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The shape of an event type: its name, its schema version, its consent category and its stored"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"properties in declaration order, as a value tooling reads."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events